# 07_genus_40hz_RGB.ledc — 40 Hz GENUS (Cognition), RGB inner/outer build
# RGB variant of 07_genus_40hz. Audio IDENTICAL (10 kHz / 40 Hz / 4% GENUS click).
# The research recommends delivering 40 Hz via a complementary-colour ANTIPHASE PAIR
# for comfort (the "invisible spectral flicker"): here the inner ring runs warm amber
# (255,160,32) and the outer ring calm blue (32,96,255) 180 out of phase, brightness-
# matched. The retina still gets the full 40 Hz oscillation, and amber<->blue is the
# STRONGEST SSVEP pair, but mean luminance stays ~flat so there is no harsh strobe.
# 40 Hz is above the 15-25 Hz danger band (GENUS exception); brightness capped 45%,
# ramps in 15 s / out 30 s. See base header. (This supersedes the old white flicker.)
#
# LED: time freq duty bright R G B mask [env phase]   (env 0 = square; phase deg)

# --- Ramp-in (00:00 -> 00:30): 40 Hz active immediately; ease brightness up ---
0       40 50 >0 255 160 32 9 0 0      # inner amber: 40 Hz, phase 0, bright ramp-in from 0
0       40 50 >0 32 96 255 6 0 180     # outer blue:  40 Hz, phase 180 (antiphase = invisible flicker)
A 0     10000 0 >0 40 1 0 0 4 0        # ch1 GENUS click: 10 kHz carrier, 40 Hz gate, 4% duty; vol fade-in
S 3000 default 52 "Beginning the forty hertz gamma protocol. Relax your gaze and let the light and tone carry you."
15000   40 50 45 255 160 32 9 0 0      # inner: brightness reaches 45% cap (15 s ramp-in)
15000   40 50 45 32 96 255 6 0 180     # outer
A 30000 10000 0 60 40 1 0 0 4 0        # ch1 vol settled 60; 40 Hz / 4% click held
S 30000 default 52 "Now holding steady at forty hertz, in gamma. Just rest here and let it work."

# --- Hold (00:30 -> 59:30): steady synchronous 40 Hz. Fixed — no drift. ---

# --- Ramp-out (59:30 -> 60:00): gentle fade of light AND audio to 0 ---
3570000 40 50 >45 255 160 32 9 0 0     # inner: brightness ramp-out START 45 ...
3570000 40 50 >45 32 96 255 6 0 180    # outer
A 3570000 10000 0 >60 40 1 0 0 4 0     # ch1 volume ramp-out START 60 ...
S 3570000 default 52 "The session is closing now. The light and tone gently fade. Well done."
3600000 40 50 0 255 160 32 9 0 0       # inner: light off
3600000 40 50 0 32 96 255 6 0 180      # outer
A 3600000 10000 0 0 40 1 0 0 4 0       # ch1 volume 0
